{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026X1hy2inRLu1794845969.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>小鵬集團第三季虧損按年擴大。</p><p></p><p>蝕8.67億元人民幣，去年同期則蝕3.8億元人民幣，期內，經調整虧損8.87億元人民幣。收入增加一成九，至242.7億元人民幣。</p><p></p><p>集團預期第四季度收入，至少304億元人民幣，較第三季增加至兩成半。汽車交付量最多17.4萬輛，按季增加最多近四成七。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T18:01:24.142928+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T16:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T09:45:10.572170+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T17:54:40.877368+00:00","content_hash":"86a72e2a1cb662f9eead3c543f4c79fc8231bac47d4da62a14116e6a318b5987","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T18:01:24.142928+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}